Status: Alive (formerly deceased)<br>
Age: 16 (11 months)<br>
Religion: Nandian (formerly Estandian)
</div>
<p><b>May</b> is the protagonist of <i>Twelve:AU</i> and a deuteragonist throughout all parts of <i>Rebirth?</i>.</p>

<h3>History</h3>
<p>May dies after being struck by lightning during a game of hide and seek. She later frees Imp from the Void and assists various vessels, eventually being revived after passing a moral test regarding her choices.</p>

<h3>Personality</h3>
<p>Emotionally intelligent, empathetic, and deeply social, May often prioritizes others over herself. Her greatest flaw is her excessive trust in those close to her, particularly Imp.</p>

